this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Ichorous_Corrosion\" title=\"Ichorous Corrosion\">Ichorous Corrosion</a></dt><dd>When the wearer deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage, they also inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a> on the target(s).</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Waning_Moon\" title=\"The Waning Moon\">The Waning Moon</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-253&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-71</span>: In a metal chest in the storeroom behind the bar</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Ichorous Corrosion:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Ichorous Corrosion is not triggered by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Fleshmelter_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fleshmelter_Cloak\" title=\"Fleshmelter Cloak\">Fleshmelter Cloak</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Ichorous Corrosion:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Despite the description stating it affects <i>targets</i>, Ichorous Corrosion only applies once per turn and thus only affects one target.\n<ul><li>It also does not mention that it only has a <i>chance</i> to apply Noxious Fumes.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 300px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 298px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png/447px-Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png/670px-Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png/893px-Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png/447px-Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"298\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Ichorous_gloves_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dy